*> XML PARSE ... PROCESSING PROCEDURE runs its procedure for every
*> event, as a PERFORM does: the procedure is reached, and returns.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. XMLREAD.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  DOC                 PIC X(100) VALUE "<a>1</a>".
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    XML PARSE DOC PROCESSING PROCEDURE HANDLE-EVENT
        ON EXCEPTION DISPLAY "BAD"
    END-XML
    STOP RUN.
HANDLE-EVENT.
    DISPLAY XML-EVENT XML-TEXT.
